Hi Aanjaneya,

Elske reported a similar problem some time ago:
http://thread.gmane.org/gmane.comp.ide.eclipse.statet/189
But it probably doesn't help.
I don't know why it doesn't work in your setup, but we can try to 
isolate the problem:

I guess the problem occurs with all topics, not only "read.csv"?

If you use the R Help search in StatET (e.g. the search button in the R 
help view), what is the result if you search for "read.csv" in the mode 
"selected fields" and select only the field "Topics/Alias"?

The log of Eclipse file named .log is located in the subdirectory 
.metadata of your Eclipse workspace directory. On some Eclipse 
